      "full_page": "Ex. \"Life of Pius X\" Leo XIII 1878 \"I must address the s. college. I fear they are about to commit a grave mistake. People think I am a learned man --- wisdom\" (Resp. of a fellow Cardinal) \"As to your learning, we, not you can best judge of that. As to your qualifications for the pon- tifical office, God knows what they are. Leave it all to Him.\" \"The social problem is not a question of charity or of donations but a question of right, and of right, and of fundamental Christian justice.\" Leo XIII \"It must be carefully observed -- only the Church of Jesus Christ has been able to preserve and surely will preserve to the sonsummation of time her form of government.\"- idem.",
      "per_polygon": "Ex. \"Life of Pius X\" Leo XIII 1878 \"I must address the s. college. I fear they are about to commit a grave mistake. People think I am a learned man --- wisdom\" (Resp. of a fellow Cardinal) \"As to your learning, we, not you can best judge of that. As to your qualifications for the pon- tifical office, God knows what they are. Leave it all to Him.\" \"The social problem is not a question of charity or of donations but a question of right, and of right, and of fundamental Christian justice.\" Leo XIII \"It must be carefully observed -- only the Church of Jesus Christ has been able to preserve and surely will preserve to the sonsummation of time her form of government.\"- idem.",
